OL,3,GNEWSACommunity-owned distillery could
OL,4,Acall in administrators
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operators of a community-owned
OL,7,Fdistillery in the Highlands say they
OL,8,Fintend to call in administrators due to
OL,9,F"commercial and legal challenges" and
OL,10,Fcosts.
OL,12,FGlenWyvis Distillery Ltd, near
OL,13,FDingwall, was launched in 2015 with the
OL,14,Fsupport of 3,000 investors, and it
OL,15,Freleased its first whisky in 2021.
OL,17,FThe company has filed a notice of
OL,18,Fintention to appoint administrators at
OL,19,Fthe Court of Session in Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
