OL,3,GNEWSACommunity-owned distillery could
OL,4,Acall in administrators
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the distillery said:
OL,7,F"The decision follows a prolonged
OL,8,Fperiod of substantive commercial,
OL,9,Foperational and legal issues on the
OL,10,Fbusiness, driven by challenging
OL,11,Fconditions across the whisky market,
OL,12,Frising operating costs and sustained
OL,13,Fexternal pressures."
